# Where `dotnet pack` puts the package, when packing locally for a consumer
# that resolves it from a folder feed rather than from a real feed.
nupkgs/

# UI render captures and baselines. EMUSEN_UI_DUMP writes .png here and
# EMUSEN_UI_BASELINE writes .frame; both are local artefacts of one machine's
# font rendering and are deliberately not committed - see docs/LunaP.md §10.2.
*.png
*.frame
